 "teaches": [
  "One ListDetail call: each message is {title: sender, subtitle: subject, preview, meta: time, lead: Avatar, unread, headline: subject, body}. About 3.8 KB of JSON for the whole adaptive screen",
  "Phone: the list, a tap opens the message with a back arrow. From 600 dp: list a third wide, the open message beside it, highlighted with a bar and a tint",
  "headline puts the subject above the sender in the message, so it is not repeated under the sender; body is plain text with blank lines between paragraphs",
  "Reply sits in the detailEnd slot, written once under whichever message is open, and sends hostNamedAction reply with the open message's index"
 ],
